  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">WBG-MEPPA - Wolfson Medical Center award for the Advanced Trauma Life Support Activity</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Cross-border communication and collaboration for patient care, particularly in the case of trauma patients, has long been a successful area of teamwork between Palestinians and Israelis. Advanced Trauma Life Support builds on this cooperation by offering internationally recognized courses for trauma care that supports not only individuals, but a systemic approach to trauma. Through shared educational, academic, and clinical programs for Israeli and Palestinian trauma surgeons, this activity optimizes trauma care for local communities while creating shared experiences and building deeper respect and lasting partnerships between colleagues.</narrative>
  </description>
